; DAC MASTER DMS-1 CONSOLE90 P0.5 — Z80 audio bootstrap
; Real Z80 opcodes generated by tools/dms_console90_firmware.py.
;
; $0000-$1FFF local Z80 RAM/driver
; $2000 CMD shared with 68000 $500000
; $2001 TRACK
; $2002 STATUS: $80 READY / $C2 RUNNING
; $5000 DSEQ CONTROL ($A7 start / $00 stop)
; $5001 DSEQ TRACK
; $6000 32 KiB DMR bank register
; $8000-$FFFF banked cartridge audio-ROM window
;
; P0.5 keeps DSEQ as a dedicated timing sequencer. The Z80 owns audio commands
; and can already see the DMR bytes through its banked ROM window. A later
; branch can move DMR parsing into Z80 software if musical timing remains exact.
